1979
01:12:42,891 --> 01:12:44,626
-Your father and I…
-What does he do?

1980
01:12:44,693 --> 01:12:46,261
…had <i>hoe </i>together!

1981
01:12:46,328 --> 01:12:47,496
Went to the sauna!

1982
01:12:47,563 --> 01:12:48,764
We did it all.

1983
01:12:48,831 --> 01:12:50,165
We had <i>hoe </i>together!

1984
01:12:50,232 --> 01:12:53,235
-We did everything together.
-Yes, man!

1985
01:12:53,302 --> 01:12:54,837
I pretty much brought you up.

