-We just do it in a bowl.

1997
01:13:15,357 --> 01:13:16,959
That sauce Chef Hyun-suk just tasted.

1998
01:13:17,025 --> 01:13:19,928
-Chef Hyun-suk, our pillar.
-Our pillar!

1999
01:13:19,995 --> 01:13:21,563
Two minutes and five seconds.

2000
01:13:21,630 --> 01:13:22,798
So?

2001
01:13:23,866 --> 01:13:25,768
Is it worthy enough to win a star?

2002
01:13:25,834 --> 01:13:27,703
Is it worthy enough to win a star?

2003
01:13:28,837 --> 01:13:31,340
It is worthy enough for a star.

2004
