-He's going to win lots of stars.
-More than one or two?

2005
01:13:34,777 --> 01:13:36,612
It tastes both Western and Chinese.

2006
01:13:36,678 --> 01:13:38,013
-Really?
-At the same time?

2007
01:13:38,080 --> 01:13:39,915
It's <i>mala, </i>but kind of mild.

2008
01:13:41,517 --> 01:13:42,584
But it's still <i>mala?</i>

2009
01:13:42,651 --> 01:13:45,721
-That's so awesome.
-It still tastes Western.

2010
01:13:45,788 --> 01:13:47,423
-I'm sure.
-It's unique.

2011
01:13:47,489 --> 01:13:49,291
I have a feeling that you sisters

2012
01:13:49,358 --> 01:13:50,692
