-No.
-It came apart?

2039
01:14:45,581 --> 01:14:46,582
He can't make the cocktail.

2040
01:14:46,648 --> 01:14:48,617
This is bad.

2041
01:14:48,684 --> 01:14:51,019
-It's an emergency.
-The rice paper came off.

2042
01:14:51,086 --> 01:14:53,121
-One minute left.
-Oh, no.

2043
