2049
01:15:09,938 --> 01:15:11,673
-The cocktail.
-Chef Hyun-suk finishes!

2050
01:15:11,740 --> 01:15:12,908
Hyun-suk is done!

2051
01:15:12,975 --> 01:15:14,676
-Our pillar!
-He's done!

2052
