2054
01:15:19,481 --> 01:15:21,817
-Martini.
-Martini.

2055
01:15:21,884 --> 01:15:22,818
The cocktail.

2056
01:15:22,885 --> 01:15:23,719
RED CAP

2057
01:15:24,520 --> 01:15:25,354
WHITE CAP

2058
01:15:26,755 --> 01:15:27,890
One minute!

2059
