SEA SQUIRT

2060
01:15:29,057 --> 01:15:30,058
Sea squirt!

2061
01:15:30,125 --> 01:15:31,593
Forty. Thirty-nine.

2062
01:15:32,194 --> 01:15:33,028
ICE

2063
01:15:33,428 --> 01:15:35,631
PLEASE

2064
01:15:36,598 --> 01:15:38,834
-Shake it!
-Shake it!

2065
