2072
01:15:55,384 --> 01:15:56,718
JONG-WON'S STOVE: CAN'T BE SAVED

2073
01:15:57,052 --> 01:15:59,655
HYUN-SUK'S STOVE

2074
01:15:59,721 --> 01:16:01,123
