THE PASTA COMES OUT OF THE OVEN TOO

2079
01:16:11,867 --> 01:16:12,701
-Five.
-Five.

2080
01:16:12,768 --> 01:16:13,635
-Four.
-Four.

2081
01:16:13,835 --> 01:16:14,903
ON TOP OF THE PASTA

2082
01:16:14,970 --> 01:16:15,904
SITS A FRIED SHRIMP

2083
01:16:16,171 --> 01:16:18,206
DONE WITH THE COCKTAIL

2084
01:16:18,273 --> 01:16:20,375
-Chef Jong-won is done too.
